        "ggrM_BYM9uM_text": "<p>A sharp, personalized gift that’s equal parts style and statement. Our best-selling monogram hats feature a bold engraved leather patch with a standout initial and custom text line—add a name, business, or short phrase (up to 20 characters). Choose from premium hat styles and colors. Whether for a friend, family member, or yourself, this is a gift they’ll wear with pride.</p>"
