        "gg1kk-39qm0_text": "Licene Plate Hats",
        "ggrvleeJmo6_text": "<p>Give a gift that reps pride, personality, and purpose. Our License Plate Hats feature weatherproof, UV-printed patches inspired by classic designs—state plates, bold graphics, flags, and more. Each one can be personalized with a name, business, or message. Built to handle real wear and weather, they’re perfect for game days, job sites, or everyday style. A gift that’s rugged, custom, and unforgettable.</p>"
