        "ggqM_g_f__h_text": "<p>A bold, one-of-a-kind gift for car lovers, garage builders, or anyone who takes pride in their space. CityLocs custom license plates come in a variety of rugged designs—from state styles to skulls, flags, and more. Each one is full-size (6\"x12\") with beveled edges and authentic detail. Add up to 16 characters to make it personal. Whether for a wall, shop, or ride—this gift always hits home.</p>"
